WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:50.910
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:13.490
<i>"Hawk-Eye Mihawk! The Great
Swordsman Zoro Falls on the Sea."</i>

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.330
Ugh...

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.340
What'd you just say?!

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.670
Nami ran off with the Going Merry?!

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:27.880
What do you mean by that?!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.400
It happened just a moment ago!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.350
What's the matter, Big Sis Nami?

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.520
Huh?

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.020
You were looking at wanted posters.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.020
Oh... Nothing...

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.690
You're impressive as usual.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.700
So you've set your eyes
on a big bounty pirate.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.370
But Arlong is the one pirate
that you shouldn't go after.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.700
I hear he's super
terrifyingly strong...

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:58.710
He kept himself quiet
and out of sight for a while.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.710
But he started going
wild again recently.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:05.310
Well, it's hard to give up on that
20-million berry bounty, though...

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.980
This guy's so strong that

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:12.320
there's a shred of possibility that
even we may be killed by a hair...

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.320
Huh?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.990
Big Sis Nami?

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:20.330
Uhm, I'm sorry, but could you turn around?
I want to change...

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.660
What?! W-well...

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.670
Change? Here? Now?!

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.000
May I?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.830
Please go ahead!

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:36.680
True to her looks, she's so bold!

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:39.680
It wouldn't hurt if we take
a quick peek, would it?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:40.840
Oh yeah...

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.700
Wh-what're you doing?!

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.800
What am I doing?
Of course, business!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:02.640
I'm a thief that only targets pirates.
I'll take this ship.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:07.480
I never said that I became a member.
I just joined forces with them. That's all.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:12.980
I only spent a short time with Luffy
and the others, but I had lots of fun.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.320
Tell them...

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.320
What?!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.650
that if we're linked by fate,
we'll meet again.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.320
Big Sis Nami!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.000
H-hey! We'll be in trouble!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.770
We were more or less
asked to watch the ship!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.360
So that's how she took the ship...

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.130
We're sorry!

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:03.300
Dammit! She's making this
crisis worse for us!

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.730
Kaya gave that ship to us!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:10.300
Wait! I can still see it!
It's the Going Merry!

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.640
Where's your ship?

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.970
We still have it here...

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:17.650
Zoro! Usopp! Leave right away!
Take that ship and follow Nami!

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:22.980
Forget about it. Just give that ship to her.
No need of going after that woman.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.650
I won't accept anyone but
her as our navigator!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.000
All right, all right...
What a high-maintenance captain...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.330
Hey Usopp, let's go!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.330
Uh? Okay...

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.680
--Big Bro Zoro, the ship is ready!
--Big Bro Zoro, the ship is ready!

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.010
Luffy, what about you?

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:54.010
I can't go since I haven't settled
anything at this restaurant.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:58.020
Be careful.
The situation here isn't normal.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.750
Yeah, I know.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:03.620
Wh-what? What the hell just happened?

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:07.290
The ship's been split into two!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.630
Look at that!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.290
It's him!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:19.040
Don Krieg! It's him!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.410
It's the man who
destroyed our fleet!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.910
Th... That man!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.520
So that man is...

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:43.160
<i>That son of a bitch!</i>

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:47.770
He followed us here... to kill us!!

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.000
We're done for!

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.010
Zoro?

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.670
Who's that?

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.680
The man I've been looking for.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.680
Hawk-Eye Mihawk!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.770
Hawk-Eye Mihawk...

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.620
The world's strongest man...

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:18.800
That's the man who sank Krieg's
50 ships on his own in the Grand Line?

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:22.400
Then, the one who destroyed Krieg's
ship just now is also...

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.310
But he looks just like
an ordinary human.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.980
It doesn't look like he has
any special weapons.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.980
His weapon is on his back...

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:34.320
That... can't be!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:38.650
Did he really slice up that large
sailing ship using that sword?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.660
He's the master swordsman Hawk-Eye...

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.490
...the man who stands above all
other swordsmen in the world...

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.000
<i>I never thought I'd be able
to see him this soon...</i>

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.010
<i>It's finally...
time to fulfill my promise...</i>

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.610
Y-you son of a bitch...

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.540
What grudge do you have
to come after us?!

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.280
Just killing time.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.770
Wha?! Don't mock us!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.300
Wh-what?!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.960
I'm sure I aimed straight for him!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.970
He averted them.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.470
He gently changed
the course of the bullets

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.970
using the point of his sword.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:32.640
That can't be true...

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:36.310
Hey! Who are you?!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:39.310
Three swords... Could it be...

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:43.320
I've never seen a sword
moved so gently...

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.990
There is no strength in swordplay
based only on force.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:49.990
Did you use that sword to slice
up this ship as well?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.660
That's right.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.650
I see... You're the strongest...

00:08:56.730 --> 00:09:01.000
I came out to sea to meet you.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.600
What's your goal?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.940
To become the strongest!

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:06.430
Hmph... How foolish...

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.950
You've got spare time, right?
Let's fight!

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:19.290
Th- this guy is Zoro! Roronoa Zoro
of the Three Swords Style!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.620
What?!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.620
Oh, a pirate hunter, huh?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.460
He is?!

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.460
Hey, this isn't good, Luffy!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.970
The Going Merry will be
out of sight soon!

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.970
Hey, Luffy!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:39.960
Fight? Hmph! How pitiful, weak one...

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.980
If you are a competent
enough swordsman,

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.880
you should be able to see
the disparity in our abilities

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.320
even before we cross swords.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:58.330
Is it your courage or ignorance that
causes you to turn your sword on me?

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.490
It's my ambition!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.330
And it's also because of a promise
I made to a dear friend!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:11.670
Hawk-Eye Mihawk, the world's strongest
swordsman and the pirate hunter Zoro...

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.680
What kind of fight will it be?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.180
There can't possibly be anyone
who can defeat Big Bro!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.510
Big Bro is the strongest already!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:28.020
Hey, what's the meaning of that?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:32.690
I'm no beast that goes all
out when hunting a rabbit.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:36.200
Even if you're a swordsman who's
earned a bit of a name for himself,

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:42.040
this sea, the East Blue,
is the weakest among the four seas.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:46.040
Unfortunately, I don't carry any smaller
sharp instrument than this one.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.710
That's enough making fun of me!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.710
Better not regret it when I kill you!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:55.050
Frog in the well...
Know how big the world is.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.380
Oni... Giri!

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.980
Wh-what?!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.660
Zoro?!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:14.000
Wha... Big Bro's Oni Giri was stopped!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.670
Even a big technique that never
fails to blow any enemy away was...

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.840
What's going on?!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:23.680
<i>I... I can't move them!
What did he do?!</i>

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.050
<i>No one has ever seen through
this technique and he stopped it</i>

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:28.350
<i>using a toy like that?!</i>

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:32.020
<i>This... can't be happening!</i>

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.350
<i>O ur abilities are this far apart?!</i>

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.450
<i>That can't be right! There's no
way that it's this far...</i>

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:43.120
The world's strongest can't be this far!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.370
This can't be happening, right,
Big Bro?! Get serious!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.040
Big Bro!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.410
We can't be this far apart!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.200
What ferocity your swordplay has...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:39.350
He's taking Zoro's Three Swords Style
attacks with such a small knife...

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:42.760
He's a monster even beyond
the monstrous Zoro!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.560
<i>I didn't pursue swordsmanship
all this time</i>

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:54.370
<i>to be dealt with by
a toy like this!</i>

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.270
Zoro...

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.980
You're lucky, Zoro.
You're a boy.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:14.660
I want to be the world's
greatest swordsman, too!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:19.830
If only... If only
I had been born a man!

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.330
Don't be whining like
that after you beat me!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:27.330
That's not fair! You're my goal!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.670
Zoro...

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.340
Promise me!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:36.340
<i>Someday, one of us will be
the world's greatest swordsman!</i>

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.680
Promise me!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.010
--It's a promise!
--It's a promise!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.950
<i>To become the world's strongest!</i>

00:13:57.030 --> 00:14:01.640
I... I'm going to get
stronger for her, too!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:08.480
I'll be the world's greatest swordsman
so that my name will reach heaven!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:11.810
I promised her... I...

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:24.150
<i>Only to defeat this man...</i>

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.140
What do you bear on your shoulders?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.340
What do you desire once you've
obtained power, weak one?

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.340
You called Big Bro a weak one?
You cross bastard!

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.010
I'll teach you a lesson! He is...

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:49.350
Stop it! Yosaku!
Johnny! Don't intervene!

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:52.010
Be patient!

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:55.510
Luffy...

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.860
I can't lose...

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.640
Tiger...

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.310
That sounds great!
The world's greatest swordsman?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.980
The King of the Pirates would need
no less than that on his crew!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.320
...Trap!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:48.310
Are you just going to
let me pierce your heart?

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.010
Why aren't you withdrawing?

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.010
I don't know...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.850
I don't know why, but...

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.180
if I withdrew even a step,

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.520
I feel like those various important
things such as pledges and promises

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.560
in the past will be shattered

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:08.300
and I won't be able to come
back to where I am now...

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:11.300
Yes, that's what defeat is about.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:14.630
Then, all the more reason
I can't withdraw...

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:16.970
Even if you'll die?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.970
I'd rather die.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:24.970
<i>What a strong heart!
So he chooses death over defeat!</i>

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.310
Kid! State your name.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.320
Roronoa Zoro.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.760
I'll remember it.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:43.630
I haven't seen anyone like you
in a while, strong one. Thus...

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.070
as a swordsman's courtesy,

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:49.000
I'll sink you using the world's
strongest black sword.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.000
I appreciate it.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:54.010
H-he took it out!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:57.010
That's the sword that sliced up the ship!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:59.350
<i>So this'll be the last hit...</i>

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.350
<i>Will it be the world's strongest?</i>

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.510
<i>Or death?</i>

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.960
Big Bro! That's enough! Please stop!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.290
Three Swords Style Secret Technique!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:14.960
Fall!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.950
Three Thousand Worlds!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.300
<i>I lost...</i>

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.970
<i>I never imagined I'd ever lose...</i>

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:36.650
<i>So this is the power
of the world's strongest...</i>

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.320
What are you...

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.490
Scars on the back are
a swordsman's shame...

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.830
Admirable!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:57.070
<i>Zoro!!</i>

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:03.280
<i>Don't live so hastily, young man.</i>

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.610
Zoro!!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.600
--Big Bro!!
--Big Bro!!

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:11.950
<i>Why?</i>

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:17.360
When I decided to become
the strongest swordsman,

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:21.120
I decided to devote my life to it.

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:26.970
<i>He's crazy! His opponent
is the real world's strongest!</i>

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:30.640
<i>How it'd turn out was clear. He should
give up his ambition rather than die!</i>

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:34.300
It should be easy...
to give up your ambition, right?!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:41.650
So this is the power of the Grand Line...
the power of the world!

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:45.320
To think the pirate hunter Zoro is
as helpless as a new-born baby!

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:49.660
Damn you, damn you... Damn you!!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.650
--Big Bro!!
--Big Bro!!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.320
Wh-what's that?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:04.440
So that brat... has the power
of a devil fruit!

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:05.770
You bastard...

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:10.280
Are you that young swordsman's comrade?

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:13.270
You also impressed me for
watching it to the very end!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:21.960
Don't worry. I didn't kill that man.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.960
What?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.460
Big Bro! Big Bro! Say something!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.620
Zoro?!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.460
Zoro!!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.970
Now, hurry up and get
him up on the ship!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:35.300
This is medicine! Throw it over him!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:41.140
It's still too early for you to die.
My name is Dracule Mihawk!

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.640
Learn about yourself!
Learn about the world!

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:44.810
And become strong!

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.350
No matter how many years it takes,

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:50.320
I will hold this seat of
the strongest and wait for you.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:52.450
Surpass this sword!

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:57.320
Try to surpass me! Roronoa Zoro!

00:19:58.320 --> 00:19:59.660
Big Bro! Big Bro, say something!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.000
Big Bro!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:07.000
To think that he got Hawk-Eye Mihawk
to say this much...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.840
<i>Kid, what is your goal?</i>

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:12.010
King of the Pirates!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:16.010
It'll be even harder
than surpassing me!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:19.680
How would I know when
I haven't done it yet?!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.680
He's alive!

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.020
He's just unconscious.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.020
Big Bro!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:26.690
Big Bro! Say something!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.690
Zoro?

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:30.180
Big Bro!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.360
L... Luffy...

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:34.690
Can you hear me?

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.860
Yeah!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:41.370
Did I worry you?

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:50.380
You need no less than the world's
greatest swordsman, right?

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.380
Big Bro! Please don't talk any more!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:53.710
Big Bro!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:21:00.380
I... I will not be defeated ever again!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:07.990
Until the day I defeat him
and become a master swordsman...

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:13.660
I'll never... be defeated!
Got any problems with that...

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.670
...King of the Pirates?!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.340
Nope!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:28.010
You're a good team.
I want to see you guys again.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.680
Hey, Hawk-Eye!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.020
Didn't you come to take my life...

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:38.020
the life of the East Blue's
ruler, Don Krieg?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:42.030
I was going to, but I had enough fun.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.360
So I'm going home to get some rest.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:49.370
You may have had enough,
but I'm tired of getting beaten.

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.700
D-Don?

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:54.040
Why are you trying to keep him here?

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:57.710
Die before you leave!!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:01.640
As I expected...
he never learns a lesson...

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:11.150
Damn! He escaped...

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:21.840
Usopp!

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:23.000
Luffy!

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:26.010
Go! I'll leave Nami to you!

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:29.840
Got it! Zoro and I will
bring Nami back for sure!

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:32.680
Make sure you get that cook to join us!

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:36.020
When all five of us
are reunited, let's go to...

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:38.020
the Grand Line!

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:40.350
Yeah! Let's do that!

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:45.360
Guys! We ran into some interference,
but the real fight starts now!

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:47.030
We'll take that ship!

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:48.360
Yeah!!

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:53.130
Pops, can I stop doing chores
if I drive them away?

00:22:53.130 --> 00:22:54.970
Suit yourself.

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
